    passage: "MEMO\n\nTo: Chief Operating Officer\nFrom: Regional Sales Manager, Pacific Division\nSubject: Request for Policy Exception — Extended Payment Terms\n\nI am writing to formally _____(1)_____ an exception to our standard 30-day payment terms for our client, Pacific Rim Distributors.\n\nPacific Rim is currently experiencing temporary _____(2)_____ difficulties due to a delayed shipment from their primary supplier. They have requested 60-day payment terms for their current invoice of $78,500. Given their _____(3)_____ payment history and a 7-year relationship with our company, I believe this exception is warranted. _____(4)_____\n\nI appreciate your prompt consideration of this request.",
